message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below and cite the external datasets separately."
title: "FloodLink-PK: Pakistan Flood-Exposure and Emergency Road-Access Research Benchmark"
version: 0.1.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24229218
date-released: 2026-11-09
authors:
  - family-names: Hussain
    given-names: Muzammal
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-2570-5686"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Pakistan
  - flood exposure
  - road network accessibility
  - emergency healthcare access
  - remote sensing
  - machine learning
  - calibration
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free synthetic research benchmark and real-data protocol for
  studying satellite-observed flood exposure on road links and the sensitivity
  of emergency healthcare accessibility estimates in flood-affected Pakistan.
  Version 0.1.0 contains synthetic experiments only and makes no empirical
  performance claim about Pakistan.
